  "body": "I've been doing some initial testing, but ideally I'd like to set up a test server in a *private* federation which has a copy of Matrix HQ (and the necessary server signing keys) which we can test against without actually spamming stuff into HQ.\r\n\r\nIt would probably take quite a bit of fiddling to get all the right data imported.\r\n\r\nThis could take the form of a third postgres dump alongside the existing \"empty\" and \"anonymised HQ\" dumps we have for setting up test servers today.",
